@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Register (201). Tự động đăng nhập, trả access + refresh token
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "a@example.com",
  "userName": "nguyenvana",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 2. Register trùng email (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "a@example.com",
  "userName": "another",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 3. Register mật khẩu yếu (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Weak Pass",
  "email": "weak@example.com",
  "userName": "weakpass",
  "password": "abc"
}

### 4. Login (200)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 5. Login sai mật khẩu (401). Gọi 5 lần liên tiếp sẽ bị khóa (423)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "a@example.com",
  "password": "Wrong@123"
}

### 6. Me (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7. Update profile (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A (updated)",
  "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.png"
}

### 8. Refresh (200). Token cũ bị revoke, cấp cặp mới
# @name refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 9. Refresh lại bằng token CŨ (401, ghi log SECURITY, revoke toàn bộ token của user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 10. Logout (204). Dùng access token + refresh token mới nhất
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### 11. Me khi không có token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
